{"run_id":"demo-po1003","seq":5,"ts":"2026-10-24T11:00:00Z","type":"step","payload":{"n":3,"frontier":[{"id":"984875e3c22d","s":"https://rai-hackathon.bbger.at/kg/chunk/DS-THERM-2200-s1","p":"https://rai-hackathon.bbger.at/ont#mentions","o":"https://rai-hackathon.bbger.at/kg/sensormodel/TMP-2210","graph":"approved"},{"id":"2151832c7759","s":"https://rai-hackathon.bbger.at/kg/sensormodel/TMP-2210","p":"https://rai-hackathon.bbger.at/ont#supplied_by","o":"https://rai-hackathon.bbger.at/kg/supplier/ThermoSense","graph":"approved"}],"nodes":[{"id":"https://rai-hackathon.bbger.at/kg/chunk/DS-THERM-2200-s1","cls":"Chunk","label":"DS-THERM-2200 §1 TMP-2210","description":null,"text":"DS-THERM-2200 Temperature Sensor TMP-2210. Measurement range -40 to +200°C. Note 1: the rated maximum for continuous operation is 200°C. Exposure above this value accelerates thermocouple ageing and may cause drift of up to ±5°C within 500 hours.","props":{"page":1}},{"id":"https://rai-hackathon.bbger.at/kg/sensormodel/TMP-2210","cls":"SensorModel","label":"TMP-2210","description":"Thermocouple temperature sensor, Series 2200.","text":null,"props":{}},{"id":"https://rai-hackathon.bbger.at/kg/supplier/ThermoSense","cls":"Supplier","label":"ThermoSense GmbH","description":null,"text":null,"props":{}}],"decisions":[{"edge_id":"984875e3c22d","verdict":"follow","reason":"This document section is about the station/sensor model."},{"edge_id":"2151832c7759","verdict":"follow","reason":"Question asks for the supplier."}],"sufficient":true}}
{"run_id":"demo-po1003","seq":6,"ts":"2026-10-24T11:00:00Z","type":"answer","payload":{"text":"Not safely at the upper limit. PO-1003 runs at ST02_SEALING, whose rule RULE-ST02-01 (SOP-001) tolerates up to 210 °C before it is critical, but the installed sensor TMP-2210 is rated for only 200 °C continuous operation (DS-THERM-2200). The sensor is supplied by ThermoSense GmbH. Escalate before running near the critical limit.","justification":"Order → station → sensor → rule gives the SOP limits; sensor → model → datasheet gives the rated maximum. The two documents disagree above 200 °C.","citations":[{"edge_id":"68dff3af3f55","chunk_id":null},{"edge_id":"34b63c1cf963","chunk_id":null},{"edge_id":"19bb6e2f0f3c","chunk_id":null},{"edge_id":"2d478e1ed0a3","chunk_id":null},{"edge_id":"76b1a8f75577","chunk_id":null},{"edge_id":"984875e3c22d","chunk_id":null},{"edge_id":"2151832c7759","chunk_id":null},{"edge_id":null,"chunk_id":"https://rai-hackathon.bbger.at/kg/chunk/SOP-001-s2"},{"edge_id":null,"chunk_id":"https://rai-hackathon.bbger.at/kg/chunk/DS-THERM-2200-s1"}],"contradictions":[{"a":"https://rai-hackathon.bbger.at/kg/chunk/SOP-001-s2","b":"https://rai-hackathon.bbger.at/kg/chunk/DS-THERM-2200-s1","note":"SOP-001 critical limit 210 °C vs. TMP-2210 rated 200 °C continuous."}]}}
